{"id":"18276c3dc8146182","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-modal-reflection-logic.md","title":"只经 MP 闭包的反射逻辑 S","display":"df-modal-reflection-logic — 只经 MP 闭包的反射逻辑 S","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-modal-reflection-logic","aliases":["72-df-modal-reflection-logic"],"display":"df-modal-reflection-logic — 只经 MP 闭包的反射逻辑 S","depends_on":["[[72-df-godel-lob-logic]]"],"chapter":"VII","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.VII §2 definition of S, print478/PDF490","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"finite closure construction and source equivalence checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"created":"2026-10-22","revision_round":"2026-10-22-expansion"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-modal-reflection-logic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-modal-reflection-logic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-modal-reflection-logic — 只经 MP 闭包的反射逻辑 S"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3fd94ba56d864509\" href=\"?note=3fd94ba56d864509\" title=\"72-df-godel-lob-logic\">72-df-godel-lob-logic</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"VII"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.VII §2 definition of S, print478/PDF490"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"finite closure construction and source equivalence checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F_m,\\mathsf{GL},\\Box_m,\\to_m\">\\(\\mathcal F_m,\\mathsf{GL},\\Box_m,\\to_m\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3fd94ba56d864509\" href=\"?note=3fd94ba56d864509\" title=\"72-df-godel-lob-logic\">72-df-godel-lob-logic</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathcal F_m\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathcal F_m\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>。下式引入反射实例集、有限 MP 阶段及逻辑 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf S_m\">\\(\\mathsf S_m\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Ref}_m&amp;:=\\{\\Box_m A\\to_m A:A\\in\\mathcal F_m\\},\\\\\nS_0&amp;:=\\mathsf{GL}\\cup\\mathsf{Ref}_m,\\\\\nS_{n+1}&amp;:=S_n\\cup\\{B\\in\\mathcal F_m:\\exists A\\in S_n\\ ((A\\to_m B)\\in S_n)\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf S_m&amp;:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}S_n,\\qquad\n\\vdash_{\\mathsf S_m}A\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow A\\in\\mathsf S_m.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Ref}_m&amp;:=\\{\\Box_m A\\to_m A:A\\in\\mathcal F_m\\},\\\\\nS_0&amp;:=\\mathsf{GL}\\cup\\mathsf{Ref}_m,\\\\\nS_{n+1}&amp;:=S_n\\cup\\{B\\in\\mathcal F_m:\\exists A\\in S_n\\ ((A\\to_m B)\\in S_n)\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf S_m&amp;:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}S_n,\\qquad\n\\vdash_{\\mathsf S_m}A\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow A\\in\\mathsf S_m.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书将 S 定义为从有限多个反射实例经 GL 的带假设关系推出的公式。本式给出同一有限 MP 闭包；任一成员只用有限多个实例，反向逐行进入某个阶段。没有添加 S 自身的必然化规则，因此不能将它当作正常模态逻辑。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-godel-lob-logic","status":"resolved","id":"3fd94ba56d864509","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-godel-lob-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-godel-lob-logic","status":"resolved","id":"3fd94ba56d864509","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal F_m,\\mathsf{GL},\\Box_m,\\to_m$ 取 [[72-df-godel-lob-logic]]；$A,B\\in\\mathcal F_m$，$n\\in\\omega$。下式引入反射实例集、有限 MP 阶段及逻辑 $\\mathsf S_m$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal F_m,\\mathsf{GL},\\Box_m,\\to_m","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathcal F_m","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf S_m","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Ref}_m&:=\\{\\Box_m A\\to_m A:A\\in\\mathcal F_m\\},\\\\\nS_0&:=\\mathsf{GL}\\cup\\mathsf{Ref}_m,\\\\\nS_{n+1}&:=S_n\\cup\\{B\\in\\mathcal F_m:\\exists A\\in S_n\\ ((A\\to_m B)\\in S_n)\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf S_m&:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}S_n,\\qquad\n\\vdash_{\\mathsf S_m}A\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow A\\in\\mathsf S_m.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1615,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-169","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VII章新增12项：[[72-cor-gl-fixed-point-equivalence]] · [[72-df-magari-algebra]] · [[72-df-modal-guarded-context]] · [[72-df-modal-reflection-logic]] · [[72-df-root-sound-modal-model]] · [[72-ex-gl-consistency-fixed-point]] · [[72-ex-gl-semantic-noncompactness]] · [[72-lem-modal-guarded-replacement]] · [[72-lem-modal-root-duplication]] · [[72-thm-finite-frame-magari-algebra]] · [[72-thm-gl-fixed-point-existence]] · [[72-thm-gl-fixed-point-uniqueness]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-166","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VII章新增12项：[[72-cor-gl-fixed-point-equivalence]] · [[72-df-magari-algebra]] · [[72-df-modal-guarded-context]] · [[72-df-modal-reflection-logic]] · [[72-df-root-sound-modal-model]] · [[72-ex-gl-consistency-fixed-point]] · [[72-ex-gl-semantic-noncompactness]] · [[72-lem-modal-guarded-replacement]] · [[72-lem-modal-root-duplication]] · [[72-thm-finite-frame-magari-algebra]] · [[72-thm-gl-fixed-point-existence]] · [[72-thm-gl-fixed-point-uniqueness]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-539","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VII章新增12项：[[72-cor-gl-fixed-point-equivalence]] · [[72-df-magari-algebra]] · [[72-df-modal-guarded-context]] · [[72-df-modal-reflection-logic]] · [[72-df-root-sound-modal-model]] · [[72-ex-gl-consistency-fixed-point]] · [[72-ex-gl-semantic-noncompactness]] · [[72-lem-modal-guarded-replacement]] · [[72-lem-modal-root-duplication]] · [[72-thm-finite-frame-magari-algebra]] · [[72-thm-gl-fixed-point-existence]] · [[72-thm-gl-fixed-point-uniqueness]]"}],"outgoing":["3fd94ba56d864509"]}